{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49683","headline":"虞美人 二 · 阎选","name":"虞美人 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚腰蛴领团香玉，鬓叠深深绿。\n月蛾星眼笑微频，柳夭桃艳不胜春，晚妆匀。\n水纹簟映青纱帐，雾罩秋波上。\n一枝娇卧醉芙蓉，良宵不得与君同，恨忡忡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎选","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}